    "description": "You naturally and unconsciously influence those who are regularly around you. Whenever you roll a natural 20 on an attack roll or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check, instead of regaining all your spent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a>, you may instead choose to grant one ally within 12 squares of you a temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>.<br><br>If your ally does not use this temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> before the end of the encounter, it is lost.",
